Z||000000||Tweek||12-29-2000||02:24 AM||||Hello all,<P>My very first car was an '84 Camaro Berlinetta.(wish I still had it) For those that are not familiar, this is the model with the digital dash(speedo, tach, odo..) Does anyone think that it would be possible to use that dash in a Fiero? Ive got an '84 auto by the way... Thanks for any and all input!!<P>-Ted||||reg||5
Z||000001||theogre||12-29-2000||09:09 AM||||Haven't seen that one yet. Likely that dash is built allot like the one in cavalier internally. Either way I'd make sure the whol dash works before messing with it. Those early GM digitals were prone to problems in the display electronics. They would process the data but the display would not show it due to an internal power problem.||||reg||1
